    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to this stunning modern detached house located in a sought-after location just off the Glencap Road This property offers four spacious bedrooms, perfect for a growing family or those in need of extra space. As you step inside, you'll be greeted by a bright and airy living area, ideal for relaxing or entertaining guests. The well-maintained garden provides a peaceful outdoor retreat, while the off-street parking and garage offer convenience and security for your vehicles. With a contemporary design and high-quality finishes throughout, this property is sure to impress even the most discerning buyers. Don't miss out on the opportunity to make this beautiful house your new home. \n\nThe very bright and spacious accommodation comprises entrance hall, large living room with gas log fire and access to the front patio through French doors, there are three double bedrooms and a modern family bathroom down the hall. The spacious modern kitchen/breakfast room boasts large island situated under a large velux window flooding the room with natural light, the kitchen also has access to the rear garden and is open plan to atrium and large living/dining room. The large living/dining room is sure to impress with its floor to ceiling wrap around French patio doors with access to the raised patio, feature built in gas fireplace. The oak staircase in the atrium leads to the gorgeous master suite with views out over the manicured rear garden, large en-suite with velux window and a mezzanine area before you enter the master bedroom with large velux window ideal area for stair gazing. \n\nEnjoying a rather rural and very scenic setting with stunning views of the Grand Sugar Loaf to the front and the Little Sugar Loaf to the rear. The property is within walking distance of Kilmacanogue (650m) and Bray is just 5.4km away or 11 minutes by car. Dublin Bus and Bus Eireann operate regular bus services from Kilmacanogue to Dublin City, the Dart is available in Bray and the Luas is also available at Cherrywood.\n\nThe property sits on a site of approximately 0.5 of an acre and has electric gates at the entrance, leading to a beautifully manicured site with ample off street parking on a cobble locked driveway and a large garage. The front garden has a well-maintained lawn and a large granite patio with raised flower beds surrounding it. The front garden is West facing ideal for sitting out in the evening and is completely private. The sunny private rear garden has a large raised granite patio area again with raised flower beds, a small covered area and steps down to the manicured lawn area. There are mature trees surrounding the lawn, a large greenhouse, kids play house with slide and an orchard of 7 types of apple trees, plum and pear trees, as well as raspberries, red currant, black currant and gooseberry bushes at the rear of the garden. \n\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and start the next chapter of your life in this fantastic property.\n\n• Beautifully presented 4 bedroom detached property \n• Accommodation of approximately 199 Sq M \n• Large living room to the front with access to front West facing patio \n• Modern kitchen with large island and velux window \n• Utility room off the kitchen \n• Steps down to the large family/dining room with wrap around doors to the rear garden\n• Master suite with views over the rear garden and little Sugarloaf\n• En-suite off the master bedroom \n• Mezzanine area off master bedroom \n• 4 double bedrooms \n• Modern bathroom \n• Manicured gardens of approximately 0.5 of an acre \n• Two granite patios \n• Large orchard in the rear garden \n• Electric gates \n• Fantastic views of Sugarloaf to the front and Little Sugarloaf to the rear \n• Ample parking on cobble lock driveway \n• Detached garage with electricity \n• Oil fired central heating \n• Under floor heating downstairs \n• Septic tank \n• Fully alarmed with CCTV\n• B2 energy rating \n• Solar panels providing hot water"
      },
      {
